The installer checks every hash above against BOTH copies, so a mismatch here
means one of the two trees drifted.

If you re-vendor (newer Tesseract.js release, or a refreshed eng.traineddata),
update the SHAs in this file AND in vendor/tesseract/LICENSE.md AND the version
strings + PINNED dictionary in install-tesseract.mjs.
